        "description": "Harsh Raj Singhania discovered that the Perl DBI module did not correctly validate certain attributes. An attacker could possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-78030)  Harsh Raj Singhania discovered that the Perl DBI module did not correctly handle certain string operations. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-88816)",
